  "description": "MongoDB support (not ownership) for Dignite.Abp.FlexFields: MongoFlexFieldIndexManagerBase<TMongoDbContext, TEntity> to keep a host's value bag in its indexable form, MongoFlexFieldQueryExecutorBase<TMongoDbContext, TEntity> to query that bag through native path filters, MongoFlexFieldRepositoryBase<TMongoDbContext, TField> for the downstream's field-definition entity, and a wildcard-index helper for the downstream's own collection configuration. There is deliberately no pivot-table entity and no FlexFieldIndexValue equivalent - a document store queries and indexes the FlexFieldDictionary in place, which is the premise the two providers are separated on. Ships no MongoDbContext and no collection; every base class is abstract over the downstream's own context interface and entity types.",
